Upstream-Name: opentelemetry-packaging
Upstream-Contact: OpenTelemetry Packaging SIG <opentelemetry-packaging@TODO>
Source: https://github.com/canonical/opentelemetry-packaging
Comment:
 This source package contains packaging scripts and configuration files
 authored by Canonical.  At build time it fetches pre-built upstream
 artifacts from several OpenTelemetry projects; those artifacts are
 distributed under their own licenses (see the Bundled-Components section
 below).  A full license audit of all bundled components is required before
 this package can be submitted to Ubuntu universe.

