# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bundled upstream components (fetched at build time, not in this source tree)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# opentelemetry-injector (libotelinject.so)
#   Source:  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-injector
#   License: Apache-2.0
#
# opentelemetry-java-instrumentation (opentelemetry-javaagent.jar)
#   Source:  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation
#   License: Apache-2.0
#   Note:    The JAR bundles many transitive dependencies.  A full bundled-
#            dependency audit is required for Ubuntu universe submission.
#
# @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node (node_modules tree)
#   Source:  https://www.npmjs.com/package/@opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node
#   License: Apache-2.0
#   Note:    The node_modules tree contains hundreds of transitive npm
#            packages, each with its own license.  A full audit is required
#            for Ubuntu universe submission.
#
# opentelemetry-dotnet-instrumentation (managed assemblies + native .so)
#   Source:  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-instrumentation
#   License: Apache-2.0
#   Note:    The .NET bundle contains managed assemblies and a native profiler
#            library.  A full audit is required for Ubuntu universe submission.
